OL,3,AAlton Towers closes World of David
OL,4,AWalliams
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe World of David Walliams attraction
OL,7,Fat Alton Towers has permanently closed,
OL,8,Fthe theme park has announced.
OL,10,FThe park's creative team worked with
OL,11,FWalliams and HarperCollins Children's
OL,12,FBooks over a number of years to develop
OL,13,Fthe section of the resort, which opened
OL,14,Fin 2021.
OL,16,F"As we are no longer in the main
OL,17,Fseason, guests are encouraged to check
OL,18,Fthe Alton Towers Resort website and app
OL,19,Ffor the latest attraction opening
OL,20,Finformation ahead of their visit," the
OL,21,Fpark said in a statement on its
OL,22,Fwebsite.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
